<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-odell-apical-constriction-invagination> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Odell, Oster, Alberch & Burnside (1981) / Martin, Kaschube & Wieschaus (2009) stretch-activated apical purse-string constriction and ventral furrow invagination (Drosophila melanogaster (gastrulating embryo ventral furrow epithelium))",
        "Odell, Oster, Alberch & Burnside (1981) / Martin, Kaschube & Wieschaus (2009) stretch-activated apical purse-string constriction and ventral furrow invagination faithfully reproduces Drosophila melanogaster (gastrulating embryo ventral furrow epithelium) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/odell-apical-constriction-invagination-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/odell-apical-constriction-invagination-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/odell-apical-constriction-invagination-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 1981-odell-apical-constriction-invagination.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Drosophila melanogaster (gastrulating embryo ventral furrow epithelium) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 60.3/100, audit 2026-10-19-apical-constriction-invagination-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/1981-odell-apical-constriction-invagination.py> ;
    schema:about "Drosophila melanogaster (gastrulating embryo ventral furrow epithelium)" ;
