    dct:description "Simulates the 5 genetic and mechanical regimes (Wild-Type Twist+Snail, No-Stretch blockade, concertina mutant, snail unratcheted mutant, and twist;snail double mutant) and a 9x9 morphospace grid, but needs finer 2D morphospace resolution and explicit rest-length relaxation convergence diagnostics." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
